            "review_title": "Review at PK Maltroom",
            "review_text": "tigerbro\nTaipei, Taiwan171 contributions\n0\nExcellent whisky bar\nApr 2025 • Couples\nA quality whisky bar. Very wide selection of fine drams to choose from - several hundred expressions available. Comfortable, classy, cosy decor. Friendly and knowlegable staff. If you want to savor some fine whisky in Saigon, go here.\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 12, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
