            "review_text": "Leo N\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nThe best whisky bar in Saigon\nApr 2023 • Friends\nThe best whisky bar on Saigon hands down. Huge selection of Scotch, some fantastic IB bottles you won’t find in any stores. The bartenders are knowledgeable and carry great whisky conversations. Let them curate for you, it’ll be some great drams\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 29, 2023",
