            "review_title": "Review at PK Maltroom",
            "review_text": "yangsw\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam24 contributions\n1\nProfessional whisky selection . Cozy atmosphere. Cocktails.\nAug 2019 • Couples\nMust be top list of whisky bars in Saigon.\nGreat and professional selection on spirits, mostly whisky, as well as some premium rums, brandy.\nAnd cocktails are real ones, with no excessive garnish, but give you the original flavor of different spirits.\nGood place to have a quality night in Saigon.\nWritten August 8, 2019",
