            "review_title": "Review at PK Maltroom",
            "review_text": "Brenick1\nDublin78 contributions\n0\nA Saigon must visit!\nDec 2018 • Couples\nI am amazed this bar only has one other Tripadvisor review! It is superb. A real gem of a bar with character and personality and is clearly a passion of the owner and the bar tender. The bar man created some of the best cocktails we have tasted after asking about our sweet/sour/spicy taste preferences. They were expertly made and presented beautifully. The bar owner has a passion for whiskey and an awesome collection from around the world! The music on our visits (yes plural!) was mainly retro and added to the vibe of a speakeasy bar that just invites you to linger and enjoy great drinks and great company! It should be more widely known. Unique and individual bars like these need to be visited and nurtured! Go there and spread the word!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 22, 2019",
